1
00:00:00,039 --> 00:00:02,840
Kelas "bantam" di tinju dan UFC...

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:05,720
ternyata namanya dari
sebuah daerah di Indonesia!

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:08,057
Lebih dari 400 tahun lalu,

4
00:00:08,057 --> 00:00:10,861
kapal Eropa berlabuh
di bandar lada Banten.

5
00:00:10,861 --> 00:00:11,598
Konon,

6
00:00:11,598 --> 00:00:13,531
pelaut membeli ayam di sana...

7
00:00:13,531 --> 00:00:14,280
kecil,

8
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,036
tapi galaknya bukan main!

9
00:00:16,036 --> 00:00:16,903
Di Inggris,

10
00:00:16,903 --> 00:00:18,915
ayam kecil disebut "bantam"...

11
00:00:18,915 --> 00:00:21,400
lalu petinju bertubuh kecil juga!

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,491
Bahkan saat Perang Dunia Pertama,

13
00:00:23,491 --> 00:00:26,174
Inggris punya pasukan
prajurit pendek bernama...

14
00:00:26,174 --> 00:00:27,110
Bantam!

15
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:27,663
Follow,

16
00:00:27,663 --> 00:00:29,977
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
